{"unit_id":"FiVE0016__dsh-fold-polish#feature-1","repo":"FiVE0016/dsh-fold-polish","commit":"eed925055bfeaa44cec7c9982f075fba75f625c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"UI 美化 的功能「折叠消息与步骤」：长消息和工作步骤可按设置收起，用户可通过界面按钮展开或再次折叠；最新轮次、流式输出和折叠行数也有相应控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/fold.js:12-28","src/fold.js:75-83","src/client-entry.js:134-135"]}
{"unit_id":"FiVE0016__dsh-fold-polish#feature-2","repo":"FiVE0016/dsh-fold-polish","commit":"eed925055bfeaa44cec7c9982f075fba75f625c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"UI 美化 的功能「调整输入框与右栏」：可调整输入框高度，并把右侧栏宽度设为 30% 至 70% 的比例；设置面板提供对应控制，关闭插件时会清理界面控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-entry.js:147-169","src/rightbar.js:20-45"]}
{"unit_id":"FiVE0016__dsh-fold-polish#feature-3","repo":"FiVE0016/dsh-fold-polish","commit":"eed925055bfeaa44cec7c9982f075fba75f625c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"UI 美化 的功能「查找会话内容」：右侧查找面板检索当前已加载的消息与步骤，命中后可展开相关内容并跳转；Enter 和 Shift+Enter 用于前后循环浏览结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-entry.js:206-252","src/find-panel.js:52-105"]}
{"unit_id":"FiVE0016__dsh-fold-polish#feature-4","repo":"FiVE0016/dsh-fold-polish","commit":"eed925055bfeaa44cec7c9982f075fba75f625c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"UI 美化 的功能「显示每轮耗时」：插件读取会话步骤的开始与完成时间，只为确认关闭且时间完整的轮次计算耗时，并将结果显示在回复旁。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-entry.js:259-267","src/turn-timer.js:10-42"]}
{"unit_id":"FiVE0016__dsh-fold-polish#feature-5","repo":"FiVE0016/dsh-fold-polish","commit":"eed925055bfeaa44cec7c9982f075fba75f625c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"UI 美化 的功能「删除本地对话」：用户从会话菜单发起删除，确认后插件请求宿主删除指定本地记录；空白或正在处理的会话会被拒绝删除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-entry.js:191-203","src/delete-panel.js:20-28","src/delete-panel.js:71-83"]}
{"unit_id":"FiVE0016__dsh-fold-polish#caveat-1","repo":"FiVE0016/dsh-fold-polish","commit":"eed925055bfeaa44cec7c9982f075fba75f625c2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"UI 美化 使用前须知：本地对话删除需用户主动确认；正在处理的对话不能删除，取消确认不会提交删除请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/delete-panel.js:20-28","src/delete-panel.js:66-80"]}
